{"id":"ee363e70c7c40e08","group":"56","path":"56/56-cor-residual-development-laws.md","title":"残余与完整发展接口补记","display":"cor-residual-development-laws — 残余与完整发展接口补记","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-cor-residual-development-laws","aliases":["56-cor-residual-development-laws"],"display":"cor-residual-development-laws — 残余与完整发展接口补记","depends_on":["[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]","[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]"],"reconstructed":"2026-10-19","reconstruction_basis":"supplied-book-56-files","historical_record_status":"original-record-not-supplied"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-cor-residual-development-laws"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-cor-residual-development-laws</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-residual-development-laws — 残余与完整发展接口补记"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06c0295d39a97a66\" href=\"?note=06c0295d39a97a66\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-unique\">56-thm-complete-development-unique</a></span></div>"},{"key":"reconstructed","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"reconstruction_basis","html":"supplied-book-56-files"},{"key":"historical_record_status","html":"original-record-not-supplied"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>工作于 ZFC，固定正交项重写系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。有限路径集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_s\">\\(\\mathbf1_s\\)</span>、首尾投影、可拼接路径的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho;\\eta\">\\(\\rho;\\eta\\)</span> 及残余传送 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a> 的上游定义。完整发展关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R\">\\(\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R\\)</span> 及其存在唯一目标采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06c0295d39a97a66\" href=\"?note=06c0295d39a97a66\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-unique\">56-thm-complete-development-unique</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\mathbf1_s,U)=U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\mathbf1_s,U)=U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(\\rho,\\eta)\\in\n\\{(\\xi,\\zeta)\\in\\mathcal F_R^2:\\operatorname{tgt}(\\xi)=\\operatorname{src}(\\zeta)\\}\n\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\\;\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho;\\eta,U)\n=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,U)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(\\rho,\\eta)\\in\n\\{(\\xi,\\zeta)\\in\\mathcal F_R^2:\\operatorname{tgt}(\\xi)=\\operatorname{src}(\\zeta)\\}\n\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\\;\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho;\\eta,U)\n=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,U)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\exists!t\\in T\\;s\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\exists!t\\in T\\;s\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点保留输入修订补记中已给出的数学断言，并依其数学内容规范名称及类型。原文件的历史重建信息仍记录在元数据中；数学含义由前两段和所列第 56 本内部依赖确定。</p>\n<p>所列公式给出零步残余、合法拼接的残余传送和完整发展的存在唯一目标。拼接参数先限制在首尾相接的路径对中；因此没有在不可拼接路径上调用部分运算。完整发展可按不同顺序进行，唯一的是终项，不是收缩序列。策略所用的残余与发展接口由这些书内节点提供，不再要求读取未附带的审阅目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-residual-transport-laws","status":"resolved","id":"b2ca2cb031a137a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-complete-development-unique","status":"resolved","id":"06c0295d39a97a66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-residual-transport-laws","status":"resolved","id":"b2ca2cb031a137a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"工作于 ZFC，固定正交项重写系统 $R$ 及 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。有限路径集 $\\mathcal F_R$、$\\mathbf1_s$、首尾投影、可拼接路径的 $\\rho;\\eta$ 及残余传送 $\\operatorname{Res}_R$ 采用 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]] 的上游定义。完整发展关系 $\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R$ 及其存在唯一目标采用 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-complete-development-unique","status":"resolved","id":"06c0295d39a97a66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"工作于 ZFC，固定正交项重写系统 $R$ 及 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。有限路径集 $\\mathcal F_R$、$\\mathbf1_s$、首尾投影、可拼接路径的 $\\rho;\\eta$ 及残余传送 $\\operatorname{Res}_R$ 采用 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]] 的上游定义。完整发展关系 $\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R$ 及其存在唯一目标采用 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho;\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\mathbf1_s,U)=U.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall(\\rho,\\eta)\\in\n\\{(\\xi,\\zeta)\\in\\mathcal F_R^2:\\operatorname{tgt}(\\xi)=\\operatorname{src}(\\zeta)\\}\n\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\\;\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho;\\eta,U)\n=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,U)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\exists!t\\in T\\;s\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t.","display":true}],"bytes":2131,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-358","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-cor-residual-development-laws.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b2ca2cb031a137a3","06c0295d39a97a66"]}